{"id": "ST_Quests|SQTC_Desc", "source_en": "Lotte has asked you to return to Shoreditch Prison and discover the fate of his old crew.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "طلبت منك لوتّه العودة إلى سجن شورديتش واكتشاف مصير طاقمه القديم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 10}}
{"id": "ST_Quests|SQCR_Desc", "source_en": "Lotte has once again called upon you to find information on someone: a woman named Aleria Hawthorne. Start your search in Shoreditch Prison again.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "استدعتك لوتّه مرة أخرى للبحث عن معلومات حول شخص ما: امرأة تدعى أليرا هاوثورن. ابدأ بحثك في سجن شورديتش مجددًا.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 10}}
{"id": "ST_Quests|SQOH_Desc", "source_en": "Lotte has tasked you to hunt down a chalice of importance to him. He's convinced that it ended up Elk Grove Academy.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "كلفتك لوتّه بالبحث عن كأس ذات أهمية كبيرة بالنسبة له. إنه مقتنع بأنها انتهى بها المطاف في أكاديمية إلك قروڤ.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 10}}
{"id": "ST_Quests|SQTAL_Desc", "source_en": "Lotte has tasked you with acquiring official Church documents from Archspire Cathedral to help him and Mereda commit a forgery. ", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "كلّفك لوتّه بالحصول على وثائق رسمية من الكنيسة من كاتدرائية أرشسباير لمساعدته هو وميريدا في تزويرها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 10}}
