{"id": "ST_Quests|SQLH_Desc", "source_en": "Mereda has discovered an artifact from the information you've collected in Gildenarch. She would like you to find the Revenant Crown and bring it to her.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "اكتشفت ميريدا أثرًا من خلال المعلومات التي جمعتها في قيلدنارك. تطلب منك العثور على تاج العائد وإحضاره إليها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 10}}
{"id": "ST_Quests|SQST_II_Desc", "source_en": "Mereda is convinced that the document you found her has a secret message encrypted in its passages. She requires the complete Cipher to crack it.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "مقتنعة ميريدا بأن الوثيقة التي أحضرتها لها تحتوي على رسالة سرية مشفرة في فقراتها. وهي بحاجة إلى الشفرة الكاملة لفكها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 10}}
